name syzygy-dtz
match *.rtbz
# A DTZ table, decoded: a line a legal position of its material that is not a draw, FEN \t its distance to zeroing, the
# plies to the next capture or pawn move under best play, positive where the side to move wins, negative where it
# loses, beyond 100 where the 50-move rule turns the result (a cursed win, a blessed loss), as Syzygy's probe gives it
# (it may be one ply more than the true distance where the table rounds). [P, "distance to zeroing", plies].
input decode syzygy
tier position by \n
names fen dtz
tier field by \t
part fen grammar fen
content fen dtz
thing position fen
relation "distance to zeroing" dtz
attest position dtz
